WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
A variable belongs to the whole app, so the next screen can read it.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.050
On screen one, the event sets Chosen, then goes to screen two.

3
00:00:10.663 --> 00:00:14.363
Screen two reads Chosen, so it knows you picked Courage.

4
00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:20.157
Screen three's List shows the Journal list, one row per entry.
